---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Refund & Cancellation Policy"
  description="Information about cancellations, damaged orders, refunds and replacement eligibility."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Order cancellations</h2>
    <p>
      Since products are prepared on demand, cancellation requests should be
      made as soon as possible after placing the order.
    </p>

    <p>
      Once preparation or dispatch has started, cancellation may no longer be
      possible.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Damaged or incorrect orders</h2>
    <p>
      Contact Vaishali Foods promptly if your order arrives damaged, incomplete
      or different from what was ordered.
    </p>

    <p>
      Clear photographs of the package, product and shipping label may be
      required for verification.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Refund eligibility</h2>
    <p>
      Refunds or replacements may be considered when:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>The wrong product was delivered.</li>
      <li>The package arrived significantly damaged.</li>
      <li>The order was not delivered and the courier confirms loss in transit.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Non-returnable products</h2>
    <p>
      Food products are generally non-returnable due to hygiene and safety
      reasons, unless the order is damaged, incorrect or otherwise eligible
      under this policy.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Refund processing</h2>
    <p>
      Approved refunds will be processed to the original payment method. Bank
      or payment-provider processing times may vary.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      For refund or cancellation assistance, use the details on our
      <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</PolicyLayout>